{"unit_id":"kendu76__dsh-music-player#feature-1","repo":"kendu76/dsh-music-player","commit":"172355b147f91ae994631aa4cbd61adfe8a5fb66","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Music Player 的功能「本地音乐播放」：扫描用户选择的音乐目录并提供播放控制。可在面板选择目录，也可通过 music_play 按歌曲或歌手关键词播放，并用工具暂停、继续、停止或切换歌曲。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:5647-5659"]}
{"unit_id":"kendu76__dsh-music-player#feature-2","repo":"kendu76/dsh-music-player","commit":"172355b147f91ae994631aa4cbd61adfe8a5fb66","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Music Player 的功能「网络音乐」：面板可搜索并播放 QQ 音乐、网易云音乐和酷狗曲库，支持登录态相关的歌单与播放能力。用户可通过 music_play 指定来源并按关键词点播。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:5650-5659","lib/qq.js:1-4","lib/netease.js:1-4","lib/kugou.js:1-4"]}
{"unit_id":"kendu76__dsh-music-player#feature-3","repo":"kendu76/dsh-music-player","commit":"172355b147f91ae994631aa4cbd61adfe8a5fb66","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Music Player 的功能「小说讲读」：读取本地 TXT 或 EPUB 小说并逐段请求 Xiaomi/MiMo 语音合成。用户可在面板选书和声音，播放时支持章节跳转与进度续读。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:3194-3198","lib/index.js:3337-3339"]}
{"unit_id":"kendu76__dsh-music-player#feature-4","repo":"kendu76/dsh-music-player","commit":"172355b147f91ae994631aa4cbd61adfe8a5fb66","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Music Player 的功能「网络电台」：从 Radio Browser 目录搜索或浏览电台，并将直播流交给播放器播放。用户可按台名、国家或标签查找，也能管理收藏和最近播放。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/radio.js:94-113","lib/index.js:5308-5320"]}
{"unit_id":"kendu76__dsh-music-player#feature-5","repo":"kendu76/dsh-music-player","commit":"172355b147f91ae994631aa4cbd61adfe8a5fb66","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Music Player 的功能「新闻语音简报」：agent 收集整理新闻后提交结构化条目，插件渲染口播稿并支持面板回看和播放。用户还可配置定时任务，由 Host 创建收集会话并处理简报。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:5831-5836","lib/index.js:6105-6108"]}
